==English==

===Etymology===
* From {{etyl|la}} ''[[detractum]]'', past participle of ''[[detraho]]''.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{transitive}} To take away; to [[withdraw]] or [[remove]].
# {{transitive}} To take [[credit]] or [[reputation]] from; to [[defame]] or [[decry]].

====Synonyms====
